the Company desires to sell to the Investors, and each Investor desires to purchase from the Company, severally and not jointly, upon
the terms and subject to the conditions stated in this Agreement, (A) shares (the &ldquo;<B>Shares</B>&rdquo;) of the Company&rsquo;s
common stock, par value $0.0001 per share (the &ldquo;<B>Common Stock</B>&rdquo;), (B) pre-funded warrants to purchase shares of Common
Stock substantially in the form attached hereto as <U>Exhibit B</U> (the &ldquo;<B>Pre-Funded Warrants</B>&rdquo;), (C) Series A common
stock purchase warrants substantially in the form attached hereto as <U>Exhibit C</U> (the &ldquo;<B>Series A Warrants</B>&rdquo;), and
(D) Series B common stock purchase warrants substantially in the form attached hereto as <U>Exhibit D</U> (the &ldquo;<B>Series B Warrants</B>&rdquo;
and, together with the Series A Warrants, the &ldquo;<B>Common Warrants</B>&rdquo;; the Common Warrants, and together with the Shares
and the Pre-Funded Warrants, the &ldquo;<B>Securities</B>&rdquo;); and</FONT></P>

