not have been suspended, as of the Closing Date, by the SEC or the National Exchange from trading thereon nor shall suspension by the
SEC or the National Exchange have been threatened, as of the Closing Date, in writing by the SEC or the National Exchange; and the Company
shall have filed with Nasdaq a Notification Form: Listing of Additional Shares for the listing of the Shares, the Pre-Funded Warrant
Shares, and the Common Warrant Shares and Nasdaq shall have raised no objection to such notice and the transactions contemplated hereby.</FONT></P>

