<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 1in"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">6.2
<U>Conditions to the Obligation of the Company</U>. The obligation of the Company to consummate the transactions to be consummated at
